        ("What is TitanFlow?", "TitanFlow is a urinary-flow supplement for men made by Zenith Labs and presented by its medical director, Dr. Ryan Shelton. Each bottle holds 60 capsules, a 30-day supply. The label lists pumpkin seed oil, pygeum, beta-sitosterol, lycopene and broccoli sprout extract."),
        ("Is it TitanFlow or Titan Flow?", "Both names refer to the same Zenith Labs product. The bottle reads \"titanflow prostate\" as one word, but many people search for it as Titan Flow."),
        ("Does TitanFlow work?", "There are no published trials on TitanFlow itself. Its main ingredients, pumpkin seed oil, pygeum and beta-sitosterol, have produced modest improvements in urinary symptoms of an enlarged prostate (BPH) in clinical studies. Expect gradual, mild-to-moderate changes at best, not results like prescription medicine."),
