        h3("3. Bladder training"), "Gradually stretch the time between bathroom visits to reduce urgency.",
        h3("4. Check your medicines"), "Decongestants, some antihistamines and diuretics can worsen flow. Ask your pharmacist about alternatives.",
        h3("5. Stay active and keep a healthy weight"), "Regular activity and less belly fat are linked to fewer urinary symptoms.",
        h3("6. Know the medical options"), "Alpha-blockers such as tamsulosin often improve flow within days; 5-alpha-reductase inhibitors such as finasteride shrink the prostate over 6–12 months. They work faster and more strongly than any supplement.",
